{"slug":"research/superposition-memorization-and-double-descent","title":"Superposition, memorization, and double descent \\ Anthropic","desc":"Toy models show networks store data points in superposition when data is scarce, switching to generalizable features as data grows.","main":"<div class=\"\"><article class=\"EaEYjq_Article\" style=\"opacity:1\"><header class=\"VYxBBq_Header\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_Content\"><h1 class=\"VYxBBq_Title\">Superposition, memorization, and double descent</h1><div class=\"yAH-gG_Actions\"><a href=\"https://transformer-circuits.pub/2023/toy-double-descent/index.html\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-medium\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Read Paper</a></div></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_MetalistContainer\" style=\"--metalist-columns:3\"><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Metalist\"><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Published</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><time datetime=\"2023-01-05\">Jan 5, 2023</time></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Team</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/interpretability\">Interpretability</a></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Topics</p><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Wrap\"><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=interpretability\">Interpretability</a></li><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=training\">Training</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_ThirdTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=scaling-laws\">Scaling laws</a></li></ul><button class=\"VYxBBq_TopicSeeMore text-caption-1 VYxBBq_ThirdTopicSeeMore\">See more...</button></li></ul></div></header><div class=\"EaEYjq_ContentWrapper\"><div class=\"EaEYjq_ConstellationPanelSlot\"><aside style=\"vis